# nauvis.surface: CORE-V1 step 6, on paper. A standalone plant, a temporary boot factory and the
# red-green main, each on its own plot; the pole chain from the plant (nauvis.fkp's bridge) and the
# poles floorplan adds to it are the only shared infrastructure.
surface  nauvis
# (3.1) `mode play` was here: a surface has properties now, and this one implied none
terrain  none                                   # a paper surface: no ore, water or cliffs yet
catalog  base

place plant = plant plot -34,-39 17x16          # the kickoff's reactor plant (a Literal)
place boot  = boot  plot -40,-10 20x26 temporary until main.running
place main  = main  plot 8,12 70x56             # the red-green part of spm10's main

watch plots:      keep
watch sanctioned: mark 2h

target automation-science-pack 10/min, logistic-science-pack 10/min
